abstract: >-
  Plexcal is a structure-aware scientific software tool for estimating
  photoexcitation energy-transfer diffusion lengths from protein structures
  using implemented Förster resonance energy transfer (FRET) and Dexter
  energy transfer (DET) models. The software supports structure visualization,
  structure-based analysis, and batch processing of protein structures.
